        "original_id": "34199e61-7274-57a2-9612-5f5ef75e9fa6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Birstall Shopping Park, Junction 27 Retail Park, Sweden\n- Companies: IKEA, Forbes\n- People: Ingvar Kamprad\n- Topics: retail parks, furniture retailing, electronics, bulky goods, wealth rankings\n\nFacts:\n- In 1943, Ingvar Kamprad founded IKEA in Sweden when he was 17 years old.\n- Since at least 2008, IKEA has been the world's largest furniture retailer.\n- In 2015, Forbes listed Ingvar Kamprad as one of the ten richest people in the world, with a fortune of more than 40 billion dollars.\n- Junction 27 Retail Park is adjacent to Birstall Shopping Park.\n- Junction 27 Retail Park specializes in bulky goods and electronics.",
